
@SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5241

### 1. Create Classroom
POST {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Classroom
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Class PA403"
}

### 2. Get All Classrooms
GET {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Classroom
Accept: application/json

### 3. Create Student
POST {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Student
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Saleh Abbasov",
  "age": 18,
  "classroomId": 2
}

### 4. Get All Students
GET {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Student
Accept: application/json

### 5. Create First Course
POST {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Course
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "C# Programming"
}

### 6. Create Second Course
POST {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Course
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Database"
}

### 7. Get All Courses
GET {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/Course
Accept: application/json

### 8. Add Student to First Course
POST {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/StudentCourse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 1
}

### 9. Add Student to Second Course
POST {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/StudentCourse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "courseId": 2
}

### 10. Get Student Courses
GET {{SchoolManagementAPI_HostAddress}}/api/StudentCourse/1
Accept: application/json
